at-boxy", "storyline": "Beat Boxy is an increasingly tough, rhythm-based 3D auto-runner featuring low-poly graphics and a catchy soundtrack. You play as Boxy; a shipping crate rocking a hat, glasses, gloves, and boots of your choosing. Boxy is continuously running straight, desperate to reach his delivery destination. It\u2019s simple enough to play with just two inputs (jump & slide), but challenging enough to test your reflexes, your patience, and your sanity.", "summary": "Beat Boxy is a 3D rhythm-based auto-runner. Play as Boxy, a shipping crate running, skateboarding & rollerblading to make his delivery. Jump & slide through dozens of rhythm-fueled levels, and build your own custom levels! Collect gems, unlock gear & survive the chaos while listening to epic music.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/beat-boxy", "videos": [{"id": 199679, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "D1YZprUIsmM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D1YZprUIsmM", "title": "Beat Boxy Game Trailer 01", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/D1YZprUIsmM/sddefault.jpg"}]}